{"id": "EUVD-2026-59543", "enisaUuid": "2a1fa181-27b1-3108-b285-ffde31a7ee65", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nRDMA/mlx5: Fix UMR XLT cleanup on ODP populate failure\n\nmlx5r_umr_update_xlt() allocates and DMA maps an XLT buffer with\nmlx5r_umr_create_xlt(). The buffer is released by the common cleanup path\nthrough mlx5r_umr_unmap_free_xlt().\n\nAfter mlx5_odp_populate_xlt() became fallible, its error path returned\ndirectly and skipped that cleanup. This leaks the XLT DMA mapping and\nbuffer. If the emergency XLT page was used, it also leaves\nxlt_emergency_page_mutex locked.\n\nBreak out of the loop so execution falls through the existing cleanup path.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T05:59:08", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:05:41", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ffa85a2c197935ace6f1634ad9eb0a44bc615670", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9619909d4869afe720904c6888a289b9ac3055b8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1eae35b37923cb71b0cb5136d00671440d488b9f"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2vqx-xvhw-m854", "CVE-2026-74396"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.73, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "082de0fd-e711-3fd0-872e-a119e51dbe88", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "241b860e-35a4-3fa3-b4df-f68066c27c73", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.16"}, {"id": "8ba0559c-632b-3169-9251-e9b439a5723a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.40"}, {"id": "9423d98e-c944-3a92-b115-69fb2ac6428b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1efe8c0670d6a6883faa09c9abc746c741f5664a <1eae35b37923cb71b0cb5136d00671440d488b9f"}, {"id": "b8a40d7b-f094-3d3c-9ba1-7370268e1868", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.5"}, {"id": "bcca7912-9b67-39ba-af7c-054a716c3afb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "bf338815-3fe0-3674-b8b1-26efcfd48d79", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1efe8c0670d6a6883faa09c9abc746c741f5664a <9619909d4869afe720904c6888a289b9ac3055b8"}, {"id": "cc2d8df2-c8d6-3682-a71d-09795ac94f32", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1efe8c0670d6a6883faa09c9abc746c741f5664a <ffa85a2c197935ace6f1634ad9eb0a44bc615670"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "83f99107-bd77-354e-9aaa-f47ce56b67c1", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}